  "suite": "examples",
  "kind": "repair",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "spec": "`alu8` is a purely combinational 8-bit ALU.\n\nInputs `a[7:0]`, `b[7:0]`, `op[1:0]`; output `y[7:0]` and `zero`.\n\n| op | y |\n|---|---|\n| 0 | a + b (mod 256) |\n| 1 | a - b (mod 256) |\n| 2 | a & b |\n| 3 | a ^ b |\n\n`zero` is 1 exactly when `y` is 0.\n",
  "top_module": "alu8",
  "files": {
    "rtl/alu8.v": "module alu8(input [7:0] a, input [7:0] b, input [1:0] op, output reg [7:0] y, output zero);\n  always @(*) begin\n    case (op)\n      2'd0: y = a + b;\n      2'd1: y = a - b;\n      2'd2: y = a & b;\n      default: y = a | b;\n    endcase\n  end\n  assign zero = (y == 8'd0);\nendmodule\n"
  },
